	(descr "Tier-3 motor encoder flex fingers: 6 fingers 0.6x1.5mm at 1.0mm pitch on BOTH copper layers, via-stitched (2x 0.3mm drill per finger), flex edge along the +y side. Bottom pad mates Flex_Landing_1x06_P1.0mm, top pad is the iron target. Pin order GND 3V3 ENCA ENCB VNTC GND. Finger length 1.5 mm to land on the 1.8 mm pads; one stitch via per finger.")
